    "turn_text": "a little challenging transition, but when you're deployed, a lot of that falls aside because you fly with wingmen. Our lives are in each other's hands. We've got to back each other up, and these are good metaphors for life. I talk about the book. We all need wingmen, especially right now, to be able to help us get through hard times and back us up and encourage us. And those are some of the things I also share and dare to fly.",
